      "description": "The OpenAPI documents this instance holds, ingested by the cat-openapi harness from the sources `cat-openapi.config.json` names (bean `s4ta`). Today one: the trust network gateway's API, which the IG's published `openapi/` carries as a vendored Swagger UI and which `ingest-ig-artifacts.ts` deliberately does not treat as the IG's own API. Each document is held VERBATIM beside a `<id>.source.json` recording the repository, path and commit it was read from; every operation in it is a node of this graph, with a page and an IRI here (`gateway/<operationId>/`, `gateway/<operationId>.jsonld`), written by `cat-openapi/scripts/gen-openapi-pages.ts`; the pages fetch the document beside them, and are complete HTML, so `served` publishes all of it verbatim.",
